The correct fix (already implemented server-side in the entire.io BFF — see `api/src/lib/repos-federation/list-repos-index.ts`'s `processingPlacement()`, not in this repo) is: pin repo-scoped reads to the repo's **processing placement**, found via the control plane's consolidated repos index (`ListRepos`), not by scanning mirrors.

